	(text "KILL bus (active high, OR of 4 sources) clamps GATE (Q3) and VSET (Q2). LOAD_DIS is pulled up: MCU hi-Z = load off.\nHW_FAULT to MCU = KILL via 10k/20k.  OTP comparator: trips ~98 C, releases ~84 C."
